    "body": "fix on issue/4076-ln2w-wire-offset · PR #4139 · pinned by script_sodick_ln2w offset::a_control_side_wire_offset_posts_in_the_owners_form, offset::a_lead_in_shorter_than_the_wire_radius_is_refused_by_name, offset::an_arc_lead_in_or_lead_out_is_refused_by_name, offset::a_first_offset_pass_on_a_condition_other_than_c001_is_refused_by_name, offset::a_section_that_ends_with_the_offset_on_is_refused_by_name, offset::the_approach_condition_with_a_wire_offset_is_refused_by_name · merges when reviewed\n\nThe app does not emit a COMP record for a Wire Contour yet. The app side (the offset mode, the part-contour path, the wire laws and the app goldens with offset on) is #4134.\n",
